@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<> a orexis:OntologyGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is

#  OREXIS EMAIL TRANSPORT. It declares no word of its own: a mailbox it reaches is a `schema:ContactPoint` with a
#  `schema:email`, schema.org's words, and which row reads it is what points at it — the channel of a `speech:Chat`
#  is a person's prose, translation's. The agent's own mailbox — its address, its credential, its servers — is
#  `secrets/<agent>/mail.env`, environment and never a graph.
